```

```css
/* Universal border-box reset */
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 20px;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto; /* Centers the container on desktop */
}

.card {
  flex: 1 1 calc(33.333% - 14px); /* Equal 3-column distribution accounting for gap */
  padding: 20px;
  border: 2px solid #ccc;
  background-color: #f9f9f9;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

/* Mobile Responsive Breakpoint */
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  .card {
    flex: 1 1 100%; /* Stacks cards into a full-width single column on phones */
  }
}
```

Explanation of Fix:
1. `box-sizing: border-box` ensures that the 20px padding and 2px border are absorbed inside the card's width rather than expanding it.
2. `display: flex` with `gap: 20px` cleanly spaces cards without buggy inline-block whitespace margins.
3. The `@media (max-width: 768px)` rule dynamically adjusts card basis to `100%`, providing a seamless responsive transition from a 3-column desktop layout to an accessible single-column mobile view.

